ployed for the full life of a project or programme, with continuity built in.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Proposition</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">On long programmes the risk is not hiring, it is keeping quality steady. <em>We plan for continuity from the start.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Long-Term%20BIM%20Staffing\">Request BIM professionals <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Disciplines available</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>BIM Management</li><li>Coordination</li><li>Architecture</li><li>Structure</li><li>MEP</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"qual\">\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">The problem</p><h3 class=\"h3\">What clients tell us</h3><ul><li>Model knowledge concentrated in one person</li><li>Quality drift over long programmes</li><li>Staff turnover mid-programme</li><li>No regular view of resource performance</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">The ENGISOFT approach</p><h3 class=\"h3\">How this model solves it</h3><ul><li>Scheduled performance and quality reviews</li><li>Backup profiles identified for key roles</li><li>Handover documentation kept current</li><li>Team size adjusted by programme phase</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Every placement includes</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Checked and recorded</h3><ul><li>Role-specific technical assessment with a verification date</li><li>Software proficiency checked against your project stack</li><li>Alignment to your BEP, LOD matrix and naming standards</li><li>Periodic performance check-ins, scoped per engagement</li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Who we place</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Professionals <em>for this model.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/verified-talent/\">How we verify talent <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel ink-rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/architectural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM Engineers</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/structural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM Engineers</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mep-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>MEP BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mechanical-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Mechanical BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/electrical-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Electrical BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/plumbing-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Plumbing BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/infrastructure-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Infrastructure BIM Engineers</b><span>Infrastructure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/landscape-bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Landscape BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/interior-bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Interior BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-coordinators/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Coordinators</b><span>BIM Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-managers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Managers</b><span>BIM Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-modelers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Modelers</b><span>Modelling</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/cad-draftsmen/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>CAD Draftsmen</b><span>Drafting</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/rebar-detailers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Rebar Detailers</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/civil-3d-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Civil 3D Engineers</b><span>Infrastructure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/scan-to-bim-specialists/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Scan-to-BIM Specialists</b><span>Specialized</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-automation-specialists/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Automation Specialists</b><span>Specialized</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Questions about <em>long-term bim staffing.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>How is performance reviewed on long engagements?<i></i></summary><p>Review intervals and the points covered are agreed at the start and recorded, so issues are raised early rather than at renewal.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if a long-term resource leaves?<i></i></summary><p>The workforce continuity process applies: handover notes, a model status log and pre-identified backup profiles.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other models</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More ways <em>to staff a project.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-staffing/\">All BIM staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Onsite BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Remote BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Resource Outsourcing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Dedicated BIM Teams</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Staff Augmentation</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Workforce Mobilization</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Workforce Continuity</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Temporary BIM Staffing</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Technical Recruitment</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n","cta":"<